From 4a1ef58f52958775dd93b6a1b7d7abcc27340afc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sergey Fedorov <barracuda@macos-powerpc.org>
Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 20:06:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/9] compat: route the Qt5 only includes through qt4compat.h

QJson*,QStandardPaths,QLockFile and QStorageInfo now come from
qt4compat.h,which forwards to Qt on Qt5 and Qt6 and to the replacements
on Qt4.

The QStandardPaths version checks in settings.cpp and engines.cpp also
accept Qt4 now,the replacement resolves to the same paths so both builds
share their configuration folder.
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01J3PANPjHirYuwBkTemGj8R
